==Latin==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|la|itc-pro|*hek(e)}}; see {{m|la|hic}} for more. Seemingly the more archaic form, retained rarely in Classical Latin as an emphatic variant and reanalysed as {{af|la|hic|-ce}}.

===Adjective===
{{head|la|adjective|feminine|haece|neuter|hoce}}

# {{ng|Emphatic form of {{m|la|hic}}.}}
